      "message": "fix(build): restore assets/ui/cube.png the packaging scripts install; pin their asset paths\n\n6792a8a3f (PR #1179) deleted the launcher icon that package-appimage,\n-flatpak, -linux, -macos and -snap read; v0.19.0's linux and macos jobs\nfailed on it. Restored byte for byte from v0.18.0. New xtask test fails on\nany OS when a path the scripts or release.yml name is missing. PROCESS_VERSION 57.\n\nFixes #1428\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
